#: ../../../plus/debug-tools/esp-prog.rst:15
msgid "ESP-Prog"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../plus/debug-tools/esp-prog.rst:20
msgid ""
"ESP-Prog is one of Espressif’s development and debugging tools, with "
"functions including automatic firmware downloading, serial communication, "
"and JTAG online debugging. ESP-Prog's automatic firmware downloading and "
"serial communication functions are supported on both the ESP8266 and ESP32 "
"platforms, while the JTAG online debugging is supported only on the ESP32 "
"platform. Official reference can be found `here <https://github.com/"
"espressif/esp-iot-solution/blob/master/documents/evaluation_boards/ESP-"
"Prog_guide_en.md?utm_source=platformio&utm_medium=docs>`__."
msgstr ""

